+// (PS4 04.29) A forward B.cond in the middle of a block: the condition true, the block is left for
+// the target. The U1: the flags may be read there (the look-ahead's); without that and with the
+// condition on the host's flags (a CondFlags* right before), A64ExitIfCondHost, which doesn't read
+// the stored flags (they may go)
+A64OPC(ExitIfCond,                                          Void,           Cond,           U64,            U1                              )
